Source: starship
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Krysztal Huang <krysztal.huang@outlook.com>
Build-Depends:
 {{RUST_PACKAGE_NAME}} (= {{RUST_PACKAGE_VERSION}}),
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 pkgconf,
 zlib1g-dev,
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: {{SOURCE_GIT}}
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: starship
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: minimal, blazing-fast, infinitely customizable prompt for any shell
 Starship is a cross-shell prompt written in Rust. It shows relevant
 information for the current directory, such as the Git branch and status,
 package versions, and runtime toolchains, while staying fast and configurable.
